I’ll compare the four frameworks—Google ADK, CrewAI, LangGraph, and Spring AI—across their architecture, strengths, limits, and enterprise readiness. The focus is on scalability, resilience, and high availability, especially for a demanding scenario like orchestrating 10,000 concurrent agents.

